    "innovation": "This modelling study demonstrates that high glaciogenic dust during the Last Glacial Maximum induced regional warming in high latitudes, driven by snow ageing in the Northern Hemisphere and longwave aerosol-cloud interactions around Antarctica, which contrasts with the general cooling effect of dust.",
